refused-chart-counts.md:5: chart: series: holds 9 series, and a chart draws 8 at most. Split it into two charts
refused-chart-counts.md:11: chart: series: 4 series of 16 values make 64 bars, and a bar chart draws 60 at most. Take fewer series or fewer x values
